    <!-- About screen -->
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_what_title">What This Is</string>
    <string name="about_what_text">Bible Companion presents the complete Bible in plain language, verse by verse, with exact references for every summary. No commentary, no personal interpretations; just faithful summaries that let the Word of God speak for itself. Silence where the text is silent.</string>
    <string name="about_features_text">Study notes cover the genealogy and divinity of Jesus, common distortions of Scripture, Bible canon formation, translation insights, and spiritual warfare. A feast calendar overlays the Hebrew and Essene calendars with the seven feasts of Leviticus 23 and their fulfillment in Christ. Prophecy tools map Messianic prophecy, Daniel’s timeline, astronomical signs, and the structure of Revelation.</string>
    <string name="about_mission_text">Free, offline, mobile-first, Tetragrammaton-honest, feast-aware, pseudepigrapha-capable, prophecy-literate, persecution-resistant, and language-precise; a tool for true discipleship (Matthew 28:19) that takes Matthew 10:8 seriously on price, Acts 17:11 seriously on login walls, Leviticus 23 seriously on calendar, Exodus 3:15 seriously on the Name, Jude 14 seriously on pseudepigrapha, and Luke 21:25 and Genesis 1:14 seriously on astronomical signs.</string>
    <string name="about_free_text">Free with no ads or monetization. All glory to God.</string>
